  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJJXCLwa6MaS4Rf9SW07MxKnA/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNnanVMalZ3EAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "A cozy little spot if you're looking for some peace and quiet, a good place to have a quick coffee catchup. Though I have to say, their coffee could use a bit more punch, it was playing it pretty safe on the flavor front or rather tasteless on my coffee tongue\nTheir early closing time (around 10-11 PM) is a bit of a bummer, especially with several 24 hour cafes nearby. But a good cafe for quiet coffee chat without the usual cafe buzz or noisy live musics *wink wink*",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "A cozy little spot if you're looking for some peace and quiet, a good place to have a quick coffee catchup. Though I have to say, their coffee could use a bit more punch, it was playing it pretty safe on the flavor front or rather tasteless on my coffee tongue\nTheir early closing time (around 10-11 PM) is a bit of a bummer, especially with several 24 hour cafes nearby. But a good cafe for quiet coffee chat without the usual cafe buzz or noisy live musics *wink wink*",
