    {
      "name": "places/ChIJJXCLwa6MaS4Rf9SW07MxKnA/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURHM1BXTWt3RRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Hidden place, but not too hidden, because it's beside on the road across the Buaran Plaza and Electronic City.\nit's very good for hangout with your partner or just chilling.\nIt's small, but giving the relaxing vibe and good for working because not too much people come.\n\nFood and beverages, overall are good, i suggest you to try spaghetti carbonara. They're creamy and delicious.\nPrice rate start from 35 to 70, exclude the liquor",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Hidden place, but not too hidden, because it's beside on the road across the Buaran Plaza and Electronic City.\nit's very good for hangout with your partner or just chilling.\nIt's small, but giving the relaxing vibe and good for working because not too much people come.\n\nFood and beverages, overall are good, i suggest you to try spaghetti carbonara. They're creamy and delicious.\nPrice rate start from 35 to 70, exclude the liquor",
